<title>USA: Ariz. 360 MW Springerville unit back to full power.</title>
<headline>Ariz. 360 MW Springerville unit back to full power.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 360 megawatt (MW) unit 1 at the Springerville coal-fired power plant in Arizona was back to full power as of early Thursday after operating near half capacity for the past several days, sources familiar with the plant's operations said Thursday.</p>
<p>The unit had been shut in late March for maintenance work.</p>
<p>The Springerville plant is operated by Tucson Electric Power Co.</p>
<p>--Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761</p>
